title: Contraptions and wiring
intro: Garry's Mod style tools and Wiremod style logic. Grab, freeze, spawn, weld, rope and wire props into machines, all as components.
project: Contraption | Gizmo Garage

chapter: Props and parts | Bodies, welds, ropes and wires
say: The new Contraption template is a room to build machines in.
select: Left Thruster
explain: component:Thruster | Thruster | A thruster pushes whatever it's welded to,
explain: component:Weld | Weld | this weld sticks it to the plank above it,
explain: component:Wire | Wire | and this wire powers it from the lift button.
select: Not Gate
explain: component:WireGate | Wire Gate | Gates do logic and math: and, or, not, toggles, latches, delays, clocks and counters.
select: Player
explain: component:SandboxTools | Sandbox Tools | And Sandbox Tools gives the player tools to build with while the game runs.

chapter: Buttons and wires | E presses a button
play
wait: 1.5
gamehover: Button
tap: E
say: Press E with the mouse over a button. This one is wired to the lamp hanging from the ceiling on a rope.
gamehover: Lift Button
tap: E
say: This one powers the two thrusters welded under that plank. Up goes the lift.
wait: 2
tap: E
say: Press it again to bring it down.
wait: 1.5

chapter: Grab and logic | Carry things, open the door
explain: hud:tools | Tools | The tools are along the top. The grab tool carries things.
gamedrag: Crate > Plate + 0, 1.5
say: Drop the crate on the plate.
waitgone: Gate Wall | 3
say: The plate's sensor goes through a not gate into the wall's Show input, so the wall goes away.
hold: D 0.6
hold: D+Space 0.5
hold: D 1
say: Past it, a clock blinks a lamp, a counter counts the ticks, and a display shows the count.
wait: 2

chapter: Build your own | Spawn, weld, wire, undo
gamebutton: tool:Spawn
explain: hud:props | Spawn | The spawn tool puts down props: crates, balloons, thrusters, lamps, buttons and gates.
gamebutton: prop:Crate
gameclick: Player + -2, 0
gamebutton: prop:Thruster
gameclick: Player + -2, 1.6
gamebutton: prop:Button
gameclick: Player + 1.5, 0
wait: 0.5
gamebutton: tool:Weld
say: Weld the thruster to the crate,
gameclick: Thruster
gameclick: Crate 2
gamebutton: tool:Wire
say: then wire the button to the thruster.
gameclick: Button 2
explain: hud:ports | Outputs | A part with more than one output asks which.
gamebutton: port:On
gameclick: Thruster
gamebutton: port:Power
gamehover: Button 2
tap: E
say: Press the button, and up it goes.
wait: 1.5
tap: Z
say: Z undoes the last thing made: the wire's gone, and down it comes.
wait: 1.5
